@voice cruz-tove
// Writer-commons, batch 0 (draft 2). Tove Cruz: senior gardener, cabin 4-18. Off Saturday and Sunday; early hours Mon
// and Tue, late hours Wed and Thu. Roster: messy, shy; night-owl, lingers-at-meals, gardener. Knows every plant by the
// week it was sown. Secretly afraid of the lift (the ladder club, with Kovac and Keane); a Gerald, and the source of
// every Gerald aboard (grows the cuttings, gives them out). In Brennan's arc: the blue sage (from beat brennan.2 only).
// Pronouns: they / them (facts.md 4b).
//
// HOW THEY TALK: mumbles to people, chats to plants. Dates everything by its sowing week ("That's a week-nine lettuce.
// Lovely age."). Trails off. Soil on everything, including the words.
// WITH JUNIORS: shy at first, then hands you a watering can and that's friendship.
// WHAT THEY NOTICE: leaves, roots, the misting timer; who's picking flowers (Ivo, Maeve, Arjun: Cruz pretends not to).
// MOOD TELLS: happy = names a seedling after you. Low = repots things that don't need it. Nervous = the ladder.
// NEVER: takes the lift if anyone's watching; tidies up.
// RUNNING: every Gerald came from Cruz; "for the exercise" (the ladder); the flower-pickers Cruz doesn't see.
tpl: shy
talk: Mumbles to people, chats to plants; dates everything by its sowing week; trails off; soil on everything.
cares: every plant in the garden, by week | the Geralds | the misting timer | the galley getting what it needs
jokes: every cactus aboard came from Tove, and is called Gerald | takes the ladder "for the exercise" | never sees who picks the flowers
hi: Oh. Hello | Hi | Mm, hello
bye: Mind the hoses | Bye, then | Go on
yes: Mm, yes | All right | Yes, fine
thanks: Thanks | Oh, ta
wow: Oh, look | Lovely
sigh: Oh, bother
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: listen
openness: guarded
loves: plant
likes: garden | sweet
invites: garden
joy: handing out Gerald cuttings
keepsake: a seed packet labelled in smudged pencil with the week you came aboard
avoid: the lift (Tove changes the subject)
